rch/TSVI+%26+DJ+Plead+Breath+Work", "search": true}, {"label": "discogs", "url": "https://www.discogs.com/search/?q=TSVI+%26+DJ+Plead+Breath+Work&type=all", "search": true}], "notes": ["“This is Breathwork by DJ Plead.”", "2024 collaborative track by TSVI & DJ Plead, from the album Caldo Verde on AD 93."]}], "counts": {"high": 1, "mid": 7, "low": 9}, "transcripts": [{"start": "00:13:10", "end": "00:14:18", "text": "You're listening to Sunset with Dot Zip on FBi Radio 94.5. Before we really get into this evening, I would just like to acknowledge that we are broadcasting live from Redfern, Waterloo on Gadigal land. I pay my respects to elders past and present and want to acknowledge any Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander peoples listening live right now or through the archives. Sovereignty was never ceded as we continue to listen to community radio here, a radio station that is staunchly protected and fiercely loved. we must continue to act further than just for airwaves, but on the ground, for the material on land, to defend stars, skies seas, and everywhere"}, {"start": "00:14:38", "end": "00:15:15", "text": "Covering sunset with Dot Zip here today. Spring, summer is blooming today. It's so nice and warm. Later I'll be joined by my beautiful, beautiful friend Sobun and you'll be hearing us mix all the way through into the evening. Whether you're cooking, listening, driving, pre-gaming, whatever, feel free to text us on 0435 123 945."}, {"start": "00:40:33", "end": "00:40:49", "text": ""}, {"start": "00:41:14", "end": "00:41:47", "text": "BELIECE."}, {"start": "00:49:46", "end": "00:50:01", "text": "You're listening to Sunset with Dot Zip on FBi Radio 94.5, this is DJ Qtiri on the mix, and I'll be joined by my very special friend Shobun."}, {"start": "01:06:10", "end": "01:06:28", "text": "You're listening to Sunset with Dot Zip on FBi Radio 94.5. You've been listening for the past hour now with me, DJ QT here on The Mix."}, {"start": "01:27:34", "end": "01:28:20"